  "rationale": "The workflow is a single-job publish/deployment workflow triggered on push to main. It has no matrix jobs, so P-LIT-FAIL-FAST does not apply. It performs no dependency installation or build steps, so P-LIT-GHA-CACHE and P-LIT-DISTRIBUTED-CACHE have nothing to cache. It has no tests to prioritize or select, no Bazel build, and no scheduled runs. P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE is explicitly contraindicated for release or deployment work, which this workflow performs. The ci_history shows only recent failures, so there is no representative successful-duration history to support P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT or P-LIT-HISTORY-TIMEOUT. No evidence-supported optimization fits this workflow without weakening permissions, adding privileged actions, or altering deployment behavior.",
  "evidence_ids": ["P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE", "P-LIT-GHA-CACHE", "P-LIT-FAIL-FAST", "P-LIT-DISTRIBUTED-CACHE", "P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT", "P-LIT-HISTORY-TIMEOUT"]
